    "body": "References #820\n\nAdds docs/compute/cuda-training.md (docs only; no crates/ changes, no cargo run). Written against main at 63ec8388 after #1649 merged. Facts re-checked against crates/uor-r4-training/Cargo.toml (cuda feature), tests/cuda_stack_ops_parity.rs, examples/geometric-stack.rs (device=cpu|metal|cuda, no implicit fallback) and docs/evidence/cuda-delivery-2026-10-03.json (18 passed / 0 failed / 1 ignored at c17411b8, 2x RTX 4090). Throughput and parity figures are copied from that evidence, not re-measured. Offline training only; no serving or reproducibility claim. Claim-wording check passed. Not merged by me.",
